---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Me — Cleve's Homepage">

  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="6">
    <tr style="vertical-align: top;">

      <!-- ===== Main content ===== -->
      <td style="width: 65%" class="bg-[#00003a] border-inset p-4">

        <h2 class="font-comic text-lg pb-1 mt-0 mb-3 border-b border-dashed border-cyan-800" style="color:#00ffff">
          About Me
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Hey! I'm <strong class="text-yellow-400">Cleve</strong>, a full-stack developer
          who's been building things on the internet for over 5 years. I still think the web
          is the most exciting platform ever made.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
          I care about clean, readable code, great user experiences, and fast-loading sites.
          Whether it's a pixel-perfect frontend or a scalable backend architecture, I'm in
          my element.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          When I'm not coding, I'm probably reading a book, contributing to open
          source, or at the gym.
        </p>

        <hr class="border-[#1a3a5c] my-4" />

        
        <h2 class="font-comic text-lg pb-1 mb-3 border-b border-dashed border-cyan-800" style="color:#00ffff">
          Skills
        </h2>

        <table width="100%" cellspacing="4" cellpadding="8" class="text-xs">
          <tr>
            <td class="bg-[#000066] win95-outer" style="width: 50%">
              <p class="text-yellow-400 font-sans font-bold mb-1">Frontend</p>
              <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-0.5 list-none p-0 m-0">
                <li>React / Next.js</li>
                <li>Svelte / Vue / Angular</li>
                <li>Tailwind CSS</li>
                <li>HTML / CSS / TypeScript</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
            <td class="bg-[#000066] win95-outer">
              <p class="text-yellow-400 font-sans font-bold mb-1">Backend</p>
              <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-0.5 list-none p-0 m-0">
                <li>Node.js / Express</li>
                <li>Python</li>
                <li>Go</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="bg-[#000066] win95-outer">
              <p class="text-yellow-400 font-sans font-bold mb-1">Databases &amp; Cloud</p>
              <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-0.5 list-none p-0 m-0">
                <li>Supabase / NeonDB</li>
                <li>MariaDB / SQLite</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
            <td class="bg-[#000066] win95-outer">
              <p class="text-yellow-400 font-sans font-bold mb-1">Tools</p>
              <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-0.5 list-none p-0 m-0">
                <li>Git / Docker / Figma</li>
                <li>Vercel / Railway</li>
                <li>PenPot / Linear / ClickUp</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="bg-[#000066] win95-outer" colspan="2">
              <p class="text-yellow-400 font-sans font-bold mb-1">Languages</p>
              <ul class="text-gray-300 list-none p-0 m-0 flex gap-6">
                <li>English</li>
                <li>Afrikaans</li>
                <li>isiZulu</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
        <hr class="border-[#1a3a5c] my-4" />

        <!-- Experience -->
        <h2 class="font-comic text-lg pb-1 mb-3 border-b border-dashed border-cyan-800" style="color:#00ffff">
          Experience
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-5">

          <!-- 21psychos -->
          <div class="border-l-2 border-cyan-800 pl-3">
            <p class="text-yellow-400 font-sans font-bold text-sm">Founder — 21psychos</p>
            <p class="text-xs mb-2" style="color:#00cccc">Present</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Founded and run a small software studio that ships client work and builds original
              products. Responsible for the full operation — from scoping and architecture through
              to development and delivery.
            </p>
            <ul class="text-xs text-gray-300 space-y-2 list-none p-0 m-0">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-1.5">
                <span class="shrink-0">🚀</span>
                <span>
                  <strong class="text-white">Supa Tail</strong> — free NPO animal adoption
                  platform connecting shelters with people looking to adopt.
                  <span class="text-green-400 font-sans font-bold ml-1">[LAUNCHED]</span>
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-1.5">
                <span class="shrink-0">🔨</span>
                <span>
                  <strong class="text-white">JS Framework / Wrapper</strong> — full-stack framework
                  with TypeScript &amp; SvelteKit on the frontend and a non-Node backend; early
                  benchmarks already outpacing Node.js.
                  <span class="text-yellow-400 font-sans font-bold animate-blink ml-1">[IN PROGRESS]</span>
                </span>
              </li>
            
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Vestraone -->
          <div class="border-l-2 border-cyan-800 pl-3">
            <p class="text-yellow-400 font-sans font-bold text-sm">Intermediate Fullstack Developer — Vestraone</p>
            <p class="text-xs mb-1" style="color:#00cccc">Feb 2026 – Oct 2026</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Designed, built, and maintained 4 production applications, owning the full lifecycle
              from architecture to deployment. Collaborated with product and design teams to translate
              business requirements into scalable, maintainable solutions.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Metaship -->
          <div class="border-l-2 border-cyan-800 pl-3">
            <p class="text-yellow-400 font-sans font-bold text-sm">Intermediate Fullstack Developer — Metaship</p>
            <p class="text-xs mb-1" style="color:#00cccc">2024 – 2026</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Primary bug-fix and ticket-handling developer, working through a continuous backlog of
              defects, features, and improvements. Triaged and resolved frontend and backend tickets
              end-to-end — from reproducing and diagnosing issues through to shipping and verifying
              fixes in production.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- The Match Exchange -->
          <div class="border-l-2 border-cyan-800 pl-3">
            <p class="text-yellow-400 font-sans font-bold text-sm">Junior Frontend Developer — The Match Exchange</p>
            <p class="text-xs mb-1" style="color:#00cccc">2024</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Handled UI updates across the platform, working directly with plain CSS to refine
              layouts, styling, and visual consistency.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- The Cutting Edge -->
          <div class="border-l-2 border-cyan-800 pl-3">
            <p class="text-yellow-400 font-sans font-bold text-sm">Information Technology Intern — The Cutting Edge</p>
            <p class="text-xs mb-1" style="color:#00cccc">2023</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Handled outgoing IT support calls, troubleshooting client issues remotely and
              coordinating on-site assistance where needed. Sourced and procured hardware equipment,
              evaluating options against requirements and managing the purchasing process.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Splitline -->
          <div class="border-l-2 border-cyan-800 pl-3">
            <p class="text-yellow-400 font-sans font-bold text-sm">Information Technology Intern — Splitline</p>
            <p class="text-xs mb-1" style="color:#00cccc">2022 – 2023</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Built a Python-based point-of-sale system from scratch, handling stock management,
              sales tracking, and basic reporting.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </td>

      <!-- ===== Sidebar ===== -->
      <td style="width: 35%" valign="top">

        <div class="bg-[#00003a] win95-outer p-3 mb-2">
          <h3 class="font-comic text-sm text-yellow-400 mb-2">Quick Facts</h3>
          <ul class="text-xs text-gray-300 space-y-1 list-none p-0 m-0">
            <li>🌐 Location: Cape Town</li>
            <li>📧 <span data-copy-email class="cursor-pointer underline" style="color:#00ffff">clevejohnclayton.2101@gmail.com</span></li>
            <li>🐙 <a href="https://github.com/manOnTheMoon2101">github.com/manOnTheMoon2101</a></li>
            <li>💼 <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/cleve-clayton-a1667836a/">linkedin.com/in/cleve-clayton</a></li>
            
          </ul>
        </div>

        

        <div class="bg-[#00003a] win95-outer p-3 mb-2">
          <h3 class="font-comic text-sm text-yellow-400 mb-2">Interests</h3>
          <ul class="text-xs text-gray-300 space-y-1 list-none p-0 m-0">
            <li>☕ Specialty coffee</li>
            <li>📖 self-improvement books</li>
            <li>🎮 gaming</li>
            <li>🌐 Open source</li>
            <li>🎵 Rock music</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <button data-copy-email class="retro-btn block text-center w-full cursor-pointer">📧 Copy Email Address!</button>

      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</Layout>
